\v 8 The \sc Lord\sc* [shall judge]{strong=“H1777” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the people| strong="H5971" \w*: [judge]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} me, O \sc Lord\sc*, \w according to my righteousness| strong="H6664" \w*, \w and according to mine integrity| strong="H8537" \w* that is in me. 
