\v 1 O \sc Lord\sc* \w our Lord| strong="H113" \w*, \w how excellent| strong="H117" \w* is \w thy name| strong="H8034" \w* \w in all the earth| strong="H776" \w*! [who hast set]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thy glory| strong="H1935" \w* \w above the heavens| strong="H8064" \w*. 
