\v 6 [Thou madest him to have dominion]{strong=“H4910” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w over the works| strong="H4639" \w* \w of thy hands| strong="H3027" \w*; [thou hast put]{strong=“H7896” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} all things \w under his feet| strong="H7272" \w*: 
