\v 6 [O thou enemy]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w destructions| strong="H2723" \w* \w are come to a perpetual| strong="H5331" \w* [end]{strong=“H8552” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [and thou hast destroyed]{strong=“H5428” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [cities]{strong=“H5892 H6145” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8676”}; \w their memorial| strong="H2143" \w* [is perished]{strong=“H6” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with them| strong="H1992" \w*.\f + \fr 9:6 \ft O thou…: or, The destructions of the enemy are come to a perpetual end: and their cities hast thou destroyed, etc \f* 
