\v 7 \w For God| strong="H430" \w* is \w the King| strong="H4428" \w* \w of all the earth| strong="H776" \w*: [sing ye praises]{strong=“H2167” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} [with understanding]{strong=“H7919” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}.\f + \fr 47:7 \ft with: or, every one that hath \f* 
