\v 23 \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [also came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*; \w and Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* [sojourned]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Ham| strong="H2526" \w*. 
