\c 120
\p 
\w A Song| strong="H7892" \w* \w of degrees| strong="H4609" \w*. 
\v 1 \w In my distress| strong="H6869" \w* [I cried]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*, [and he heard]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} me. 
\v 2 [Deliver]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w my soul| strong="H5315" \w*, O \sc Lord\sc*, \w from lying| strong="H8267" \w* \w lips| strong="H8193" \w*, and \w from a deceitful| strong="H7423" \w* \w tongue| strong="H3956" \w*. 
