\v 4 [Sharp]{strong=“H8150” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w arrows| strong="H2671" \w* \w of the mighty| strong="H1368" \w*, \w with coals| strong="H1513" \w* \w of juniper| strong="H7574" \w*.\f + \fr 120:4 \ft Sharp…: or, It is as the sharp arrows of the mighty man, with coals of juniper \f* 
