\c 121
\p 
\w A Song| strong="H7892" \w* \w of degrees| strong="H4609" \w*. 
\v 1 [I will lift up]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w mine eyes| strong="H5869" \w* \w unto the hills| strong="H2022" \w*, \w from whence| strong="H370" \w* [cometh]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my help| strong="H5828" \w*.\f + \fr 121:1 \ft I will…: or, Shall I lift up mine eyes to the hills? whence should my help come? \f* 
