\v 5 The \sc Lord\sc* is [thy keeper]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: the \sc Lord\sc* is \w thy shade| strong="H6738" \w* \w upon thy right| strong="H3225" \w* \w hand| strong="H3027" \w*. 
\v 6 \w The sun| strong="H8121" \w* [shall not smite]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w thee by day| strong="H3119" \w*, \w nor the moon| strong="H3394" \w* \w by night| strong="H3915" \w*. 
