\c 122
\p 
\w A Song| strong="H7892" \w* \w of degrees| strong="H4609" \w* \w of David| strong="H1732" \w*. 
\v 1 [I was glad]{strong=“H8055” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [when they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [unto me, Let us go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*. 
